Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace the product constellation in the hero with an animated method dial
driven by HERO_METHODS, keeping products out of the general messaging.
Problems drift into the core, a dial turns to the chosen method, and the
outcome card shows problem → outcome with an autoplay progress bar.
Slower 6.5s cycle, keyboard navigation, reduced-motion support, and
animations pause while off-screen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HxepQWiZ7t67FwE6cbZ1UK
